WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.040
Look at how Supreme evolved from a small label into a global company valued at over a billion dollars.

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:06.640
It’s not just about selling products; it’s about selling a lifestyle.

00:00:06.640 --> 00:00:09.840
From the logo to carefully designed pieces that became globally recognized styles.

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:13.600
They added a sense of soul to the brand,

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.760
bringing a mindset and unique elements into their designs.

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:18.960
Their collaborations are unexpected.

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:21.040
Their collaborations are strange.

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:22.640
Their collaborations are impossible to predict.
